ent-SunriseSponsorClothingModsuitBackCMO = Hippocrates MOD control unit
    .desc = The control unit of the Hippocrates MOD, an advanced suit by DeForest Medical Corporation. A red cross stands out on its turquoise casing.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterModsuitBodyCMO = Hippocrates MOD chestplate
    .desc = The turquoise chestplate of the Hippocrates MOD, worn over a crimson undersuit with white shoulder pads.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetModsuitCMO = Hippocrates MOD helmet
    .desc = A dark MOD helmet with a large teal visor.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHandsModsuitCMO = Hippocrates MOD gauntlets
    .desc = Crimson gloves with turquoise plates over the knuckles, part of the Hippocrates MOD.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingModsuitShoesCMO = Hippocrates MOD boots
    .desc = Bulky turquoise boots of the Hippocrates MOD, each marked with a medical cross.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingModsuitBackSafeguard = Dictator MOD control unit
    .desc = The control unit of a special version of the security MOD, made just for the head of security. It is itching to beat a changeling to death with itself.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterModsuitBodySafeguard = Dictator MOD chestplate
    .desc = A black and red MOD chestplate with gold inserts. Its look alone inspires awe.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetModsuitSafeguard = Dictator MOD helmet
    .desc = A red and black MOD helmet shaped like an officer's peaked cap. Any Syndicate agent feels uneasy under its gaze.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHandsModsuitSafeguard = Dictator MOD gauntlets
    .desc = Massive black and red MOD gauntlets. They grip a heretic's neck with authority.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingModsuitShoesSafeguard = Dictator MOD boots
    .desc = Heavy black MOD boots, stained with the blood of revolutionaries.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingModsuitBackSyndicateMedic = Medical MOD control unit
    .desc = The control unit of a medical suit designed by the Gorlex Marauders. Built for field medicine under fire.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterModsuitBodySyndicateMedic = Medical MOD chestplate
    .desc = A red MOD chestplate with white shoulder pads and a white cross on the chest.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetModsuitSyndicateMedic = Medical MOD helmet
    .desc = A dark red MOD helmet with small horns and green visor lights.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHandsModsuitSyndicateMedic = Medical MOD gauntlets
    .desc = Dark red MOD gauntlets that fit snugly on the hands.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingModsuitShoesSyndicate = Medical MOD boots
    .desc = Chunky MOD boots that match the rest of the suit.
